  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意，要使用我的模組，您需要安裝此函式庫，其中包含其他模組所需的全部內容。</span></h1><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">COBBLEMORE 函式庫</h1><p>◽儲存我所有模組之間共用的物品/資源/合成配方/代碼的系統。<br>◽部分我的模組需要此系統才能運作。<br>◽JEI 搜尋標籤為「cobblemore」</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><br>我的模組：</h1><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblemon-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_bc53f78d-303b-42ba-8cf1-432880111c6b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-pokecenters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a06ced40-ba05-41b8-b825-2c04d21b1daa.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-egg-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_874907dd-1c16-4623-a8e1-b250fa69d933.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-smart-healer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_ef5fb44c-113e-4fe6-a208-3542c670447c.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-poke-labs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a1a0d1aa-1c16-461c-896b-f6c3a456c046.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-mekanism-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_26c495f1-de71-4b09-996c-215e2b525d05.png\" width=\"100\" height=